WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
Human names lead into release identity.

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:13.130
OpenHW records a JEDEC value in mvendorid, an architecture ID in marchid, and an implementation ID in mimpid.

3
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:25.551
The current catalog lists architecture IDs for E40P, E40X, E40S, and E20, while E40P versions one and two have different implementation IDs.

4
00:00:25.551 --> 00:00:29.721
A Git tag or RTL freeze then pins exact source.

5
00:00:29.721 --> 00:00:36.020
This chain is stronger than a slide title or repository default branch.

